<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Lab Report — REP-183923</title>
  <style>
    @media print { body { padding: 0; background: #fff; } .no-print { display: none !important; } .report-box { border: none !important; box-shadow: none !important; padding: 0 !important; } }
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; color: #0F2A4A; background: #F8FAFC; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .report-box { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #CBD5E1; border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .header-table { width: 100%; border-bottom: 2px solid #0A4DA6; padding-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .brand-title { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #06306B; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
    .brand-sub { font-size: 13px; color: #0AB2A7; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 4px; }
    .patient-card { background: #F1F5F9; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px; }
    .test-badge { background: #0A4DA6; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    table.results-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 14px; }
    table.results-table th { background: #06306B; color: #ffffff; text-align: left; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
    table.results-table td { padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0; }
    table.results-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #F8FAFC; }
    .section-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #06306B; margin-top: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #0AB2A7; padding-left: 10px; }
    .notes-box { background: #FAF5FF; border: 1px solid #E9D5FF; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #581C87; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .signatures-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 36px; pt-4; border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0; padding-top: 20px; }
    .sig-block { text-align: center; width: 200px; }
    .sig-line { border-bottom: 1.5px solid #0F2A4A; margin-bottom: 6px; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; font-style: italic; font-weight: 700; color: #0A4DA6; }
    .footer-note { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: #64748B; margin-top: 28px; border-top: 1px dashed #CBD5E1; padding-top: 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="no-print" style="max-width:800px; margin:0 auto 16px auto; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; background:#ffffff; padding:12px 20px; border-radius:12px; border:1px solid #CBD5E1;">
    <div style="font-weight:700; color:#06306B;">📄 Niramaya Hospitals — Laboratory Test Report (REP-183923)</div>
    <button onclick="window.print()" style="background:#0D6EFD; color:#ffffff; border:none; padding:8px 18px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; font-size:13px;">🖨️ Save as PDF / Print</button>
  </div>
  <div class="report-box">
    <table class="header-table">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <div class="brand-title">🏥 NIRAMAYA HOSPITALS</div>
          <div class="brand-sub">Compassion. Care. Cure.</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748B; margin-top: 6px;">Department of Diagnostic Pathology & Clinical Laboratories</div>
        </td>
        <td style="text-align: right;">
          <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #06306B;">LABORATORY TEST REPORT</div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #475569;">Report ID: <b>REP-183923</b></div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #475569;">Booking ID: <b>LAB-767065</b></div>
          <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #475569;">Report Date: <b>05 Aug 2026</b></div>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="patient-card">
      <div><b>Patient Unique ID:</b> PT100842</div>
      <div><b>Recommending Doctor:</b> Dr. Ananya Rao</div>
      <div><b>Patient Name:</b> Rekha Prasad</div>
      <div><b>Department:</b> General Medicine</div>
      <div><b>Age / Gender:</b> 30 Years / Female</div>
      <div><b>Sample Status:</b> <span style="color: #00C853; font-weight: 700;">Verified & Processed</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="test-badge">🧪 Diagnostic Test: Urine Test</div>

    <table class="results-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Parameter / Investigation</th>
      <th>Observed Result</th>
      <th>Reference Range</th>
      <th>Unit</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Urine Test Result</b></td>
      <td><b style="color:#0A4DA6;">Normal Diagnostic Parameters</b></td>
      <td>Standard Reference</td>
      <td>Clinical Unit</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

    <div class="section-title">CLINICAL INTERPRETATION</div>
    <div class="notes-box">Patient test results lie within normal diagnostic ranges.</div>

    <div class="section-title">PATHOLOGIST REMARKS</div>
    <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 24px;">No pathological abnormality identified.</div>

    <div class="signatures-row">
      <div class="sig-block">
        <div class="sig-line">Senior Lab Tech</div>
        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569;">Laboratory Technician</div>
        <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #94A3B8;">Niramaya Clinical Labs</div>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <div style="width: 70px; height: 70px; border: 2px dashed #0AB2A7; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: #0AB2A7; margin: 0 auto 4px auto;">SEAL<br>VERIFIED</div>
        <div style="font-size: 9px; color: #64748B;">QR: REP-183923</div>
      </div>

      <div class="sig-block">
        <div class="sig-line">Dr. Ananya Rao (Verified)</div>
        <div style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569;">Chief Pathologist</div>
        <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #94A3B8;">MD Pathology (Niramaya)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-note">
      This report is generated electronically by Niramaya Hospitals Smart Management System.<br>
      Verification Code: <b>1915779714</b> &nbsp;|&nbsp; 24/7 Diagnostics Desk: +91 44 2834 9000
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>